				Basic Commenting

Program Comments
	• a non-executing statement
	• provides information about the program
	• helps explain the code
	• three types of documentation
		o line comment // comment
		o block comment /* comments */
		o javadoc comment /** comments */

Line Comment
	• starts with //
	• used for one line of comment
		// this is a one line comment

	• will not affect the program
	• provides information to the programmer

Block Comment
	• starts with /*
	• ends with */
		/*
 		     this is a comment that
 		     is more than one line
		*/
	• used for more than one line of comment

javadoc Comment
	• starts with /**
	• ends with */
	• note the extra asterisk
		/**
		      this is a comment that
		      will appear in an html page
 		*/
	• adds comments to html pages generated by javadoc
	• to be discussed later
